      "statement": "Cilium 1.17.0 adds services protocol differentiation, enabled by default and controllable with the cilium-agent flag --bpf-lb-proto-diff; after the upgrade, existing Services without a protocol set are preserved as such and must be deleted and recreated for their protocol to be taken into account by the agent."
